  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Bridging For Sustainability Initiative</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&quot;Bridging for Sustainability&quot; initiative builds on DKT&#x2019;s role in providing family planning (FP) and sexual and 
reproductive health (SRH) solutions in Ethiopia, aiming to improve access, strengthen the 
private sector and enhance financial sustainability. It addresses challenges like high maternal 
mortality and unmet family planning needs through a hybrid social marketing model and the 
Social Impact&#xb2; (SI2) financing approach. DKT Ethiopia seeks to improve service delivery, 
increase awareness, and achieve sustainable health outcomes, aligning with national priorities 
and the Sustainable Development Goals.</narrative>
  </description>
